  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "With the recent ability to change the name, description and tags of your world on the website, it seems that any change will bump your world to the top of \"New\".\n\nThe devs have indicated that the \"fix\" for this behavior is to have the \"New\" list only show worlds that have been created recently. This is a HORRIBLE idea, as I already explained in this Canny: https://vrchat.canny.io/vrchat-2017/p/add-a-recently-updated-tab-to-the-worlds-list\n\nSince this suggestion doesn't really fit in the other Canny, I'm doing it here. A world should only be bumped to the top of *any* \"recently created\" or \"recently updated\" list if it actually gets reuploaded. A simple name change should not bump it to the top of the list at all.",
